is a new prognostic factor for survival in patients with brain tumors</article-title><source>Clin Cancer Res</source><year>1999</year><volume>5</volume><fpage>559</fpage><lpage>567</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10100707</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kirschke</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Eerola</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Hopsu-Havu</surname><given-names>VK</given-names></name><name><surname>Bromme</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Vuorio</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Antisense RNA inhibition of cathepsin L expression reduces tumorigenicity of malignant cells</article-title><source>Eur J Cancer</source><year>2000</year><volume>36</volume><fpage>787</fpage><lpage>795</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10762753</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0959-8049(00)00014-9</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Chambers</surname><given-names>AF</given-names></name><name><surname>Colella</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Denhardt</surname><given-names>DT</given-names></name><name><surname>Wilson</surname><given-names>SM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Increased expression of cathepsins L and B and decreased activity of their inhibitors in metastatic, ras-transformed NIH 3T3 cells</article-title><source>Mol Carcinog</source><year>1992</year><volume>5</volume><fpage>238</fpage><lpage>245</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1586450</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1002/mc.2940050311</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Frade</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Rodrigues-Lima</surname><given-names>F<